<title>CHINA: Shanghai grain futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Shanghai grain futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai Cereals &amp; Oils Exchange is closed for two weeks starting Monday for the lunar new year holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on February 17, Monday.</p>
</text>
